    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let us examine the conversation line by line.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Ты кто такой?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Who are you?' Spotting a stranger in a chef's coat, Barinov demands to know who he is.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Что ты улыбаешься?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What are you smiling at?' The man only smiles silently, making Viktor ask what he is grinning at.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Давай, отвечай.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Come on, answer.' Impatient, the chef tells the newcomer to speak up and answer.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Айнура, это японец?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Aynura, is this a Japanese person?' Turning to Ainura, Viktor asks if the silent man is Japanese.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "ainura",
      "t": "Нет.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No.' Ainura shakes her head and says no.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "ainura",
      "t": "Он не наш.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He is not ours.' She clarifies that he is not one of her relatives or countrymen.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Слушай, ты перепутал.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Listen, you made a mistake.' Thinking the man walked into the wrong kitchen, Viktor says he made a mistake.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Суши делают рядом.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'They make sushi next door.' Barinov points out that the sushi bar is next door, not here.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "senya",
      "t": "Шеф, это новый повар.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Chef, this is the new cook.' Senya steps in to explain that the man actually is their new cook.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Какой повар?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What cook?' Baffled, Viktor asks what kind of cook Senya means.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "senya",
      "t": "Он будет делать суши.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He will make sushi.' Senya reveals that the new owner hired him to roll sushi in their French kitchen.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Иди отсюда.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Get out of here.' Outraged by the idea of sushi in his restaurant, Barinov orders the man out. Now let's listen to the whole conversation again from start to finish.",
